# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
#  What is NOT versioned, and why.
#
#  Rule: a file that a command rebuilds from a file that IS versioned
#  does not belong here. Every binary in a repository is a merge
#  conflict that git cannot resolve, and a source of "it works for me".
#
#  The four documents (thesis-en.pdf, thesis-el.pdf and the two .docx)
#  are outputs. `make all` builds them from this tree in about half a
#  minute. Attach them to a release or an e-mail; do not commit them.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------

# LaTeX by-products
*.aux
*.bbl
*.blg
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.lof
*.log
*.lot
*.out
*.run.xml
*.synctex.gz
*.toc
*.xdv
*.dvi

# the built documents
thesis-en.pdf
thesis-el.pdf
/figures/out/

# everything the .docx pipeline generates
docx/build/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# editors and operating systems
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
.vscode/
.idea/
